*.swo
*~

# MacOS files
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Logs
*.log
# Rotated log files (netadmin.log.1, .log.2, ...) — `*.log` does not match these,
# and the daemon's own log dir holds operational network data that must never be
# committed to a public repo.
*.log.[0-9]*
data/logs/
Logging/
# Self-upgrade working directory. The journal records the daemon's environment so
# the runner can respawn it, which means it holds whatever secrets were exported
# (the API token, controller credentials). It also holds pre-upgrade database
# backups. Neither may ever be committed.
data/upgrade/
Logging/

